8	 *
9	 * Plans/prices are pulled from the real live pages (rust-server-hosting,
10	 * satisfactory-server-hosting, palworld) so the mock reads true.
11	 *
12	 * Social proof is split into two clearly-distinct things (2026-08-29 revision):
13	 *   - The real aggregate rating/count is <ReviewBadges/> (Google/Trustpilot/
14	 *     HostAdvice), rendered by the route page and passed in as a prop. That is
15	 *     the only place a star average or review count is ever shown.
16	 *   - `reviews` below are ILLUSTRATIVE example feedback, not real customer
17	 *     submissions — no invented personal names and no per-quote star rating
18	 *     (that would imply a specific measured score). Attribution is a generic
19	 *     `role` string (e.g. "Rust wipe admin") and every render of this data is
20	 *     required to visibly label it as illustrative/example content.
21	 */
